  "review_notes": [
    "Corrected: *thee* in *to save thee* had been folded into מוֹשִׁיעַ's unit. Rule 44 makes a supplied object pronoun with no object morpheme its own `added` unit, as the chapter already does at 28.39 and 28.68.",
